# The build context of the api image is the repository root (api/Dockerfile reads web/, api/ and contracts/).
# The engine image has its own, narrower list in engine/Dockerfile.dockerignore, which BuildKit prefers.
# No secret and no build output of the host may reach an image.
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.claude
dev
docs
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/bin
**/obj
**/dist
**/.angular
**/TestResults
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/__pycache__
web/e2e/screenshots
